# --- Generated, reproducible with one command
# `python -m pipeline.run` writes these; the web app's own copy
# (web/src/data, web/public/briefs, web/public/approach.pdf) IS committed,
# because the hosted build runs only `npm run build`.
output/
web/public/approach.html

# `python -m evaluation.run` -- REPORT.md is kept; the rest is regenerated.
evaluation/runs/
evaluation/results.json
